<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>I will sing of the mercies of the Lord forever,</l><l>I will sing, I will sing;</l><l>What a mercy that I am in the church forever;</l><l>I will sing of the mercies of the Lord.</l><l>(Do not repeat chorus)</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
